Hi <%= @member.name.split.first %>,

You're confirmed for <%= @event.name %>. Your payment has been received.

  <%= @event.starts_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p") %>
  <%= @event.venue %>

PAYMENT SUMMARY
  Ticket price: <%= number_to_currency(@event.price_cents / 100.0) %>
<% if @rsvp.donation_amount_cents.to_i > 0 %>
  Charitable donation: <%= number_to_currency(@rsvp.donation_amount_cents / 100.0) %>
<% end %>
<% if @rsvp.donation_amount_cents.to_i > 0 && @club.receipt_configured? %>

CHARITABLE CONTRIBUTION RECEIPT
  <%= @club.legal_name %>
  EIN: <%= @club.ein %>
<% if @club.ca_registry_number.present? %>
  CA Registry: <%= @club.ca_registry_number %>
<% end %>
  Date: <%= @rsvp.paid_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>
  Contribution amount: <%= number_to_currency(@rsvp.donation_amount_cents / 100.0) %>

  No goods or services were provided in exchange for this contribution.
<% end %>

A calendar invite (.ics file) is attached to this email.

See you there,
<%= @club.name %>
